9333efdb-31cb-4724-a6d5-533fda96446a	5e52edd3-2698-4788-9eee-1427332d92c0	bcd5c0e1-6dd7-41ab-ba8f-506be1008cff	MCQ	EASY	An AME is performing a scheduled inspection on a light aircraft's aileron control system. The AME finds that the aileron push-pull tube has a slight bend that is within the manufacturer's allowable limits. What is the CORRECT action?	{"Replace the push-pull tube immediately, as any bend indicates structural weakness.","Document the bend in the technical records, note that it is within limits, and continue with the inspection.","Straighten the tube using a hydraulic press to ensure perfect alignment.","Apply a temporary repair with a doubler plate and proceed with the inspection."}	A	CAR 571.02 requires following the manufacturer's recommendations. If the bend is within the specified allowable limits, the part is serviceable. The AME must record the condition in the technical records per 571.03. Option B is correct. Options A and C are incorrect because replacement or straightening is not required if within limits, and straightening could introduce stress risers. Option D is wrong because temporary repairs are not authorized for flight controls without approved data.	APPROVED	chat-generate:manual	2026-05-18 20:42:25.982	2026-05-18 20:51:11.928	f6803850-70b6-4c77-86cc-553a219bbdce	Le RAC 571.02 exige de suivre les recommandations du fabricant. Si la courbure est dans les limites admissibles spécifiées, la pièce est en état de service. Le TEA doit enregistrer la condition dans les dossiers techniques conformément au 571.03. L'option B est correcte. Les options A et C sont incorrectes car le remplacement ou le redressement n'est pas requis si dans les limites, et le redressement pourrait introduire des concentrateurs de contrainte. L'option D est fausse car les réparations temporaires ne sont pas autorisées pour les commandes de vol sans données approuvées.	["Remplacer immédiatement le tube de poussée-traction, car toute courbure indique une faiblesse 