979233b1-613b-4b61-a35e-26a8ed6deeed	5e52edd3-2698-4788-9eee-1427332d92c0	cf079001-08a4-4c0b-8974-447003927d1b	MCQ	HARD	An AME is performing a daily inspection on a large transport category aircraft. The inspection is part of a line maintenance program. According to Standard 573.02(3)(c), what is the limitation of a 'Line Maintenance' rating?	{"It includes all scheduled checks, including A, B, C, and D checks.","It is limited to pre-flight, daily, and weekly checks, and rectification of defects.","It allows for any maintenance as long as it is performed on the flight line.","It excludes any maintenance on engines and propellers."}	D	Standard 573.02(3)(c) defines a 'Line Maintenance' limitation as maintenance limited to pre-flight, daily, and weekly checks, and includes the rectification of defects, provided the maintenance is not specialized maintenance. It specifically excludes any scheduled checks that include segmented portions of higher-level checks. Option A is incorrect because those are higher-level checks. Option C is incorrect because it is not just any maintenance on the flight line. Option D is incorrect because line maintenance can include engine and propeller tasks within its scope.	APPROVED	chat-generate:manual	2026-05-18 19:01:44.81	2026-05-18 20:51:11.928	f6803850-70b6-4c77-86cc-553a219bbdce	La norme 573.02(3)(c) définit une limitation 'Maintenance en ligne' comme une maintenance limitée aux vérifications avant vol, quotidiennes et hebdomadaires, et inclut la rectification des défauts, à condition que la maintenance ne soit pas spécialisée. Elle exclut spécifiquement toute vérification programmée qui comprend des parties segmentées de vérifications de niveau supérieur. L'option A est incorrecte car ce sont des vérifications de niveau supérieur. L'option C est incorrecte car il ne s'agit pas de n'importe quelle maintenance sur la ligne de vol. L'option D est incorrecte car la maintenance en ligne peut inclure des tâches sur les moteurs et les hélices 